hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19259","Al-Husayn ibn Muhammad narrated to us, Sharik narrated to us and Yazid ibn Ata from Yazid meaning Ibn Abi Ziyad from Abd al-Rahman ibn Sabit from Ayyash ibn Abi Rabiah who said: I heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: This ummah remains in good while they honor this sanctity with its due honor. If they abandon it and neglect it they perish. He said in the hadith of Yazid ibn Ata: From the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
"19260","Aswad ibn Amir narrated to us, Sharik narrated to us from Yazid from Ibn Sabit from al-Muttalib or from al-Ayyash ibn Abi Rabiah who said: I heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and he mentioned the like of it."
